<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Heartland Wireless cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Heartland Wireless cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it lowered its recommendation on Heartland Wireless Communications Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were off four points to 15-1/8 in early afternoon Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
